<title>SWITZERLAND: Swiss Life forecasts premium growth.</title>
<headline>Swiss Life forecasts premium growth.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Insurer Swiss Life said it expected premiums to show double digit growth in 1996.</p>
<p>Group life insurance should experience double digit growth, but the company expected to report a slight decline in personal insurance, Swiss Life said in a statement.</p>
<p>Nonetheless, the added premiums from its UBS Swiss Life venture should result in the double digit growth, it added.</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
